mapping "Q858W.1" source="Q858W" target="78572006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Q858W = Swedish residual SNOMED CT 78572006 under ICD-10 Q85.8 (Other phakomatoses, NEC).
        Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps Q85.8 to SNOMED CT 4302754 (78572006, standard_concept=S), which is the
        OMOP broader parent for phakomatoses. The residual bucket is heterogeneous; target subsumes all
        specified phakomatoses not elsewhere classified. Moderate tier: crosswalk-verified parent for a
        residual source.
        """
}
