    comment "en" """
        Source Q870M SNOMED CT 65094009 (a very rare ectodermal dysplasia affecting hair, teeth, nails). No
        SNOMED CT concept with this exact name exists. SNOMED CT 4305592 is a DIFFERENT entity (involves
        bone/osseous changes, not nails) and is NOT a match. Best available standard target is the Q87.0
        crosswalk parent 4274970 (standard_concept=S), which subsumes all Q87.0 sub-codes broadly but
        only loosely covers this ultra-rare syndrome. Low tier: genuine doubt, no defensible specific
        target.
        """
}
